{
  "name": "FORENSE_reconciliador",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "seconds",
              "secondsInterval": 10
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "name": "Cada 10 s"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "-- Leases vencidos, tareas huérfanas y pasos sin avance. La ejecución conserva su fence_token: el siguiente claim_step lo incrementa y deja fuera al proceso viejo (17 §4).\nSELECT r.ok, r.clusters, r.tareas, r.ejecuciones, r.slots, r.solicitudes, r.pasos\n  FROM jsonb_to_record(forense.recover_expired(now()))\n    AS r(ok boolean, clusters int, tareas int, ejecuciones int, slots int,\n         solicitudes int, pasos int)",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "name": "Slots vencidos",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "name": "Forense Postgres"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "-- 17 §2: ocho pasos activos como máximo. El reconciliador es RECUPERACIÓN, no el camino normal: el dispatcher es inmediato al guardar checkpoint.\nSELECT e.id AS execution_id, e.caso_id, e.tarea_id, e.corrida_id, e.rol,\n       'reconciliador'::text AS owner\n  FROM forense.ejecuciones_agente e\n  WHERE e.estado_interno NOT IN ('terminado','error','timeout')\n    AND e.lease_owner IS NULL\n    AND (e.deadline_at IS NULL OR e.deadline_at > now())\n  ORDER BY e.actualizado\n  LIMIT 8",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "name": "Pasos recuperables",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "name": "Forense Postgres"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "PENDIENTE_FORENSE_EJECUTAR_AGENTE",
          "cachedResultName": "FORENSE_ejecutar_agente"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "execution_id": "={{ $json.execution_id }}",
            "tarea_id": "={{ $json.tarea_id }}",
            "owner": "={{ $json.owner }}"
          }
        },
        "mode": "each",
        "options": {
          "waitForSubWorkflow": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "name": "Redespachar pasos"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "-- Cierra barreras con deadline vencido marcando limitaciones y llama a advance_case_if_ready. Error o timeout NO es ausencia de fraude (07). DEPENDE de forense-db.\nSELECT * FROM forense.cerrar_barreras_vencidas(now())",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        440,
        140
      ],
      "name": "Barreras vencidas",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "name": "Forense Postgres"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "-- Reenvía eventos de eventos_salida no entregados (16 §2). El backoff de outbox NO equivale a repetir una llamada ya aceptada. DEPENDE de 007.\nSELECT * FROM forense.eventos_salida_pendientes(nullif(nullif($1::text, 'null'), '')::int)",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ (20) ?? 'null' }}"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        660,
        140
      ],
      "name": "Outbox pendiente",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "name": "Forense Postgres"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "PENDIENTE_FORENSE_NOTIFICAR_COMPLETADA",
          "cachedResultName": "FORENSE_notificar_completada"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "evento_id": "={{ $json.evento_id }}"
          }
        },
        "mode": "each",
        "options": {
          "waitForSubWorkflow": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        880,
        140
      ],
      "name": "Reenviar outbox"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "FORENSE_reconciliador (17 §3).\n\nCada 10 s, configurable y a validar en la instancia.\nEs la RED DE SEGURIDAD, no el camino normal.\nNo hace polling al LLM.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        420
      ],
      "name": "Nota reconciliador"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
